      "content": "Of course, I'd be happy to help you with this. Here's a few questions that you might consider for your survey:\n\n1. Over the past month, how often have you felt an increased desire to engage in exploration or venture into unfamiliar areas?\n2. Have you ever acted impulsively, without considering the potential consequences? If so, how often has this happened in the past six months?\n3. How would you rate your level of comfort being in large groups of people, versus being alone or with a couple of friends?\n4. Have you ever engaged in activities that others may consider risky or outside of the law, such as illegal drug use, and if so, how often does this occur?\n5. How often do you feel an urge to be the \"first one in line,\" the one who initiates a new experience in a group or environment?\n6. Have you ever experienced feelings of anxiety or restlessness when staying at home for an extended period of time?\n7. Do you tend to be highly talkative in new situations, comparing this to being reserved and quietly observing your surroundings first? \n\nRemember that your questions should be open-ended or provide multiple-choice answers for inexperienced respondents. Always respect privacy and ensure consent in the middle of the",
